<title>USA: Saliva Diagnostic AIDS test OK'd in Russia.</title>
<headline>Saliva Diagnostic AIDS test OK'd in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER, Wash. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saliva Diagnostic Systems Inc said its rapid HIV test was approved for use and sale in Russia. The test detects HIV antibodies in the blood.</p>
<p>Saliva Diagnositcs said the test was found to be 100 percent sensitive in trials carried out in Russia.</p>
<p>Russia is the first country to approve the test.</p>
</text>
